OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after gun found in park
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man has been jailed for six years
OL,6,Fafter a gun with his DNA on it was
OL,7,Fdiscovered in a park.
OL,9,FThe handgun was found in a canvas bag
OL,10,Fin a wooded area of East Carlton Park
OL,11,Fin Corby just before 12:00 GMT on 17
OL,12,FNovember 2025 by an off-duty PCSO who
OL,13,Fwas walking his dog.
OL,15,FForensic tests found DNA from Jakub
OL,16,FSawa, 27, on the left-hand side of the
OL,17,Fgrip. He was charged with possession of
OL,18,Fa firearm.
OL,20,FSawa was found guilty at Northampton
OL,21,FCrown Court on 14 August and was
OL,22,Fsentenced on 15 September.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
